  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROTECT/ICMPD: Improving Migration Management &amp; Migrant Protection in selected Silk Route countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective is to contribute to migrant protection in the target countries covering all phases of (in and out) migration, including countering and preventing irregular migration, trafficking in human beings and smuggling of migrants.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
